{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_10_indexes_expression_page", "label": "Expression indexes", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-10-indexes/expression.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_10_indexes_expression_expression_index", "label": "Expression index", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-10-indexes/expression.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Index the function result when the query cannot leave the column bare. The query must spell the expression identically; each queried expression needs its own index."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_10_indexes_expression_immutable_requirement", "label": "IMMUTABLE index expression", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-10-indexes/expression.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Anything whose result depends on session TimeZone or now() is STABLE, not IMMUTABLE, and cannot be indexed (42P17). Name the zone: date_trunc('day', ts, 'UTC') or (ts AT TIME ZONE 'UTC')::date."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_10_indexes_expression_expression_statistics", "label": "Expression-index statistics", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-10-indexes/expression.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ANALYZE collects statistics for the expression itself under the index name in pg_stats, so the planner stops guessing selectivity."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_10_indexes_expression_case_insensitive_unique"